WEBVTT

00:09:58.565 --> 00:10:00.153
Bigger clan gatherings and so on.

00:10:00.177 --> 00:10:01.878
But maybe it's a bad thing as well.

00:10:01.902 --> 00:10:04.183
How many fathers in the room?
Raise your hands.

00:10:04.207 --> 00:10:07.535
OK, so experts think
that one to three percent of you

00:10:07.559 --> 00:10:09.662
are not actually the father of your child.

00:10:09.686 --> 00:10:11.440
(Laughter)

00:10:11.464 --> 00:10:12.640
Look --

00:10:12.664 --> 00:10:16.640
(Laughter)

00:10:17.611 --> 00:10:19.976
These genomes, these 23 chromosomes,

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:23.365
they don't in any way represent
the quality of our relationships

00:10:23.389 --> 00:10:26.082
or the nature of our society --
at least not yet.

00:10:26.106 --> 00:10:27.901
And like any new technology,

00:10:27.925 --> 00:10:29.714
it's really in humanity's hands

00:10:29.738 --> 00:10:31.936
to wield it for the betterment of mankind